+2.  **Unskew Origin:**
+    Calculate the unskew factor $t$:
+    $$ t = (i + j + k) \times G_3 $$
+    Calculate the coordinates of the simplex cell origin $\mathbf{X}_0$ in the original (unskewed) space:
+    $$ X_0 = i - t $$
+    $$ Y_0 = j - t $$
+    $$ Z_0 = k - t $$
