+        *   Else if $x_0 < z_0$:
+            *   $(i_1, j_1, k_1) = (0, 1, 0)$
+            *   $(i_2, j_2, k_2) = (0, 1, 1)$
+        *   Else:
+            *   $(i_1, j_1, k_1) = (0, 1, 0)$
+            *   $(i_2, j_2, k_2) = (1, 1, 0)$
+
+    Calculate the relative coordinates for the remaining three corners:
+    $$ \mathbf{x}_1 = \mathbf{x}_0 - (i_1, j_1, k_1) + G_3 $$
+    $$ \mathbf{x}_2 = \mathbf{x}_0 - (i_2, j_2, k_2) + 2 G_3 $$
+    $$ \mathbf{x}_3 = \mathbf{x}_0 - (1, 1, 1) + 3 G_3 $$
